{"blocks":[{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/ami.noujo/img/blog/ami.noujo/img/2014/10/11/8475767/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みつ愛未ちゃんです。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"アンダーライブ絶賛やっておりまする"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"やっと昨日で3分の1が終わったところ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"こう考えるとなかなかのロングランだねやっぱり(￣▽￣)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"会場見回して「じょ」のうちわとか、\nあみあみタオルとか、能條愛未タオルとか、見つけると本当に嬉しい気持ちになるっ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"思わず爆レス？送りたくなっちゃう❤️笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"千秋楽までどうぞよろしくね(-_^)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あみの全力スマイルに注目してくだちゃい。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"えへへへへへ、へ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/ami.noujo/img/blog/ami.noujo/img/2014/10/11/8475767/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"メガネ姉妹"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/ami.noujo/img/blog/ami.noujo/img/2014/10/11/8475767/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あすか顔ちっさ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いや、でもさこれさ遠近法だからしょーがないし(￣O￣;)......笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そうそう！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"NOGIBINGO!3始まったねぇ〜〜〜っ^o^"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"イジリーしゃん(*^^*)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"囲み取材でなぜか能條の名前だしてもらったりした。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"なぜだ。でも有り難きですね。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"がんばらにゃっ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あとのぎ天！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今回は街ぶらロケをしてきました！\nあみは下北沢に行ってきたです。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まにと優里と飛鳥とOL姉さんといってきた。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あみ的に注目してほしいのは、うさぎカフェ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ちょっと頑張っちゃったから見て欲しい。笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"なんかね投票出来るシステムになってて、一番投票多いところのチームにどうやら良いことがあるらしいのよ、笑\nすごいざっくりした説明で申し訳ない詳しくは優里のブログ見てね(￣▽￣)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そう、だからあみ達下北沢チームに投票して？？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"☆☆☆☆☆☆☆☆☆☆☆☆☆☆☆☆☆☆"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みんな、知ってる？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"能條さんあと一週間くらいで２０歳になっちゃうらしいよ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"えー、無理なんだけどー。←ギャル"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そうかぁ十代終わりかぁ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"別にさ二十代になったからって\nこーなにが嫌なのかってわからないけど嫌だって言いたいよね。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"若いって本当素晴らしいことなんだね"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"昔誰かに言われたことあるけど今この言葉がめちゃ染みる。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"なんかすごく込み上げてくるものたくさんあるけどまあ今の私の心情がそうだねおよそ5分くらいでわかるものが"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今回のわたしの個人pvでございます。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ちゃんと真剣にお歌も歌ったからさ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"観てね。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"観て、ね。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/ami.noujo/img/blog/ami.noujo/img/2014/10/11/8475767/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ぐちゃぐちゃケーキ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"個人pvで食べたんだけどスタッフさん達とむさぼった結果こうなりました❤️"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/ami.noujo/img/blog/ami.noujo/img/2014/10/11/8475767/0004.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「あの日 僕は咄嗟に嘘をついた」"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"MV観ていただけましたか？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ドラマじたてになっておる。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"能條さんちょこちょこ映ってるから観てね。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/ami.noujo/img/blog/ami.noujo/img/2014/10/11/8475767/0005.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"さてとアンダーライブ、今日から3日連続2公演がはじまるどっ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ここ山場、確実に。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"乗り切りましょう。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/ami.noujo/img/blog/ami.noujo/img/2014/10/11/8475767/0006.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"この写真のさゆにゃんが好き❤️笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"我の帽子が邪魔で映れてない(￣▽￣)笑"}],"source":"archive"}